2. BRAND - All rights reserved
==============================

The following are the visual identity of José Carlos Martínez ("JC"), and are
NOT covered by the MIT License above:

  - The names and marks "jcbrand", "JC", "José Carlos Martínez" and
    "jcmartinez.net", and any logo, icon or illustration, including
    everything in assets/ now or in the future.
  - The values of the design tokens, which are what defines the look of the
    brand: the colors (the palette, in core and in both themes), the choice
    of typefaces, and the values of the type scale, spacing, radius, shadow,
    motion, blur and opacity. They are in tokens/ and dist/, and are listed
    in reference/tokens.md.
  - The brand guidelines: the "Reglas de marca" part of reference/guide.md
    (palette, contrast, typography and use of the values).

Copyright (c) 2026 José Carlos Martínez. All rights reserved.

Without prior written permission from the copyright holder you may NOT use,
copy, publish, distribute, sublicense or sell the Brand, in whole or in part.
This includes using the same values, or values that are only a minor variation
of them, to reproduce the same look as your own. You also may NOT use the Brand
in a way that suggests that your work is, or is endorsed by, JC or
jcmartinez.net.

You MAY read them, and clone or fork this repository to study it, as the
terms of GitHub allow. You MAY use the skeleton of part 1 with your own
values and your own brand.

To ask for permission, contact the author through https://jcmartinez.net.


